ems":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/rulesets/20849492","domain":"api.github.com","title":"20849492","cloud_doc_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/rulesets/20849492"}]}]},{"key":"https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/704ee0eec17b0f5aeb7608620fc6de3a579c2174/docs/vnext-seed/operations/digest-canonicalization.md","domain":"github.com","url":"https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/704ee0eec17b0f5aeb7608620fc6de3a579c2174/docs/vnext-seed/operations/digest-canonicalization.md","titles":[{"key":"https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/704ee0eec17b0f5aeb7608620fc6de3a579c2174/docs/vnext-seed/operations/digest-canonicalization.md-digest-canonicalization.md","title":"digest-canonicalization.md","items":[{"url":"https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/704ee0eec17b0f5aeb7608620fc6de3a579c2174/docs/vnext-seed/operations/digest-canonicalization.md","domain":"github.com","title":"digest-canonicalization.md","cloud_doc_url":"https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/blob/704ee0eec17b0f5aeb7608620fc6de3a579c2174/docs/vnext-seed/operations/digest-canonicalization.md"}]}]},{"key":"https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/d1375b976c915ae27b6fb7bc60be800632648cb2","domain":"github.com","url":"https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/d1375b976c915ae27b6fb7bc60be800632648cb2","titles":[{"key":"https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/d1375b976c915ae27b6fb7bc60be800632648cb2-docs(r5): publish the independent audit of the current baseline (#150)\n\nIndependent read-only audit at e537349c: all 11 section 3.5 gates exit 0\n(2074/2074 tracked paths owned, format matrix 0 complete / 14 partial /\n2 custody-only), Python 2894 passed / 46 skipped, Rust 79 suites / 197 tests /\n0 failures, C# build 0 warnings 0 errors, vocabulary contract 29 cases,\nCoreSupervisor 9/9, Avalonia smoke OK, and local main = origin/main = remote\nHEAD with no divergence and no open pull request.\n\nNew findings that the DSH completion report does not record: the whole\n40-entry scoop shim directory targets prefix-less paths that do not exist\n(the earlier report sampled three); PROJECT_CONTRACT.yaml's digest_profile\npoints at a document path that is absent while the schema pins the\nAAK-JCS-1 constant; TASKS.json and R5-STATE.json disagree on X00/X04/X05/X07;\nmain is guarded by ruleset 20849492 (required check a0-gates) rather than\nclassic branch protection, so the protection API returns 404 and can be\nmisread as \"unprotected\"; and the Rust suite yields false red unless it runs\nthrough dev.py with Tesseract bound.\n\nNo task status, independent-audit field, branch, tag, release or workflow file\nis modified by this commit.\n\nCo-authored-by: DTALEX66 <DTALEX66@users.noreply.github.com>","title":"docs(r5): publish the independent audit of the current baseline (#150)\n\nIndependent read-only audit at e537349c: all 11 section 3.5 gates exit 0\n(2074/2074 tracked paths owned, format matrix 0 complete / 14 partial /\n2 custody-only), Python 2894 passed / 46 skipped, Rust 79 suites / 197 tests /\n0 failures, C# build 0 warnings 0 errors, vocabulary contract 29 cases,\nCoreSupervisor 9/9, Avalonia smoke OK, and local main = origin/main = remote\nHEAD with no divergence and no open pull request.\n\nNew findings that the DSH completion report does not record: the whole\n40-entry scoop shim directory targets prefix-less paths that do not exist\n(the earlier report sampled three); PROJECT_CONTRACT.yaml's digest_profile\npoints at a document path that is absent while the schema pins the\nAAK-JCS-1 constant; TASKS.json and R5-STATE.json disagree on X00/X04/X05/X07;\nmain is guarded by ruleset 20849492 (required check a0-gates) rather than\nclassic branch protection, so the protection API returns 404 and can be\nmisread as \"unprotected\"; and the Rust suite yields false red unless it runs\nthrough dev.py with Tesseract bound.\n\nNo task status, independent-audit field, branch, tag, release or workflow file\nis modified by this commit.\n\nCo-authored-by: DTALEX66 <DTALEX66@users.noreply.github.com>","items":[{"url":"https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/d1375b976c915ae27b6fb7bc60be800632648cb2","domain":"github.com","title":"docs(r5): publish the independent audit of the current baseline (#150)\n\nIndependent read-only audit at e537349c: all 11 section 3.5 gates exit 0\n(2074/2074 tracked paths owned, format matrix 0 complete / 14 partial /\n2 custody-only), Python 2894 passed / 46 skipped, Rust 79 suites / 197 tests /\n0 failures, C# build 0 warnings 0 errors, vocabulary contract 29 cases,\nCoreSupervisor 9/9, Avalonia smoke OK, and local main = origin/main = remote\nHEAD with no divergence and no open pull request.\n\nNew findings that the DSH completion report does not record: the whole\n40-entry scoop shim directory targets prefix-less paths that do not exist\n(the earlier report sampled three); PROJECT_CONTRACT.yaml's digest_profile\npoints at a document path that is absent while the schema pins the\nAAK-JCS-1 constant; TASKS.json and R5-STATE.json disagree on X00/X04/X05/X07;\nmain is guarded by ruleset 20849492 (required check a0-gates) rather than\nclassic branch protection, so the protection API returns 404 and can be\nmisread as \"unprotected\"; and the Rust suite yields false red unless it runs\nthrough dev.py with Tesseract bound.\n\nNo task status, independent-audit field, branch, tag, release or workflow file\nis modified by this commit.\n\nCo-authored-by: DTALEX66 <DTALEX66@users.noreply.github.com>","cloud_doc_url":"https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/d1375b976c915ae27b6fb7bc60be800632648cb2"}]}]},{"key":"https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/e50e444d66127173d57f55f46b0b68f24020b97f","domain":"github.com","url":"https://github.com/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/commit/e50e44